    "body": "## Summary\n\nCloses the \"pixel-based rendering tests\" item in ADR-082's status note.\n\n- Adds `tests/test_inline_baseline_paint.cpp` (4 tests, tag `[adr082]`) that drives the real `break_styled_words_into_lines` and `paint::paint` through a deterministic stub measurer, asserting pixel colours at computed baseline coordinates.\n- Covers mixed-font baseline sharing, length-offset `vertical-align`, multi-line wrap stacking, and inline-block baseline alignment.\n- Updates ADR-082: marks the pixel-test item done and narrows the remaining gap to nested inline / painted `sup`/`sub` / `top`-`bottom` edge alignment.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `cmake --build build --target honeybee_tests`\n- [x] `./build/tests/honeybee_tests \"[adr082]\"` — 4/4 new tests pass\n- [x] `./build/tests/honeybee_tests` — full suite: 2979 assertions in 758 test cases, all green\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-23T10:58:23Z",
